<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$47.8 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$47.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two promissory note issuers came to the Australian market via tenders for a total of A$47.8 million on Monday.</p>
<p>McDonald's Corp's Australian unit made the larger issue, selling A$30 million of its late January-dated paper at about three points over the nearest bank bill mid-rate.</p>
